===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|porque}}, corresponding to {{compound|pt|por|que|t1=for|t2=that}}.

Cognate with {{cog|gl,es|porque}}, {{cog|ca|perquè}}, {{cog|fr|parce que}} and {{cog|it|perché}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA|pt=purque|br=purquê}}
