==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{af|es|por|que|t1=for; due to|t2=what}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr|+<audio:LL-Q1321 (spa)-Rodelar-porque.wav>}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|es|conjunction}}

# [[because]]

====Usage notes====
* The subordinate clause that {{m|es||porque}} introduces is most often in the indicative.
* When {{m|es||porque}} is negated — when one thing is said ''not'' to be because of another — its subordinate clause is in the subjunctive.

